         RowBox[{"LabelStyle", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
           RowBox[{"20", ",", 
            RowBox[{"FontFamily", "->", "\"\<Times New Roman\>\""}]}], 
           "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
